{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/pulls/2743","id":4769246815,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJ0zDAs8AAAABHETuXw","html_url":"https://github.com/0xMiden/node/pull/2743","diff_url":"https://github.com/0xMiden/node/pull/2743.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/0xMiden/node/pull/2743.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/issues/2743","number":2743,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(usdcx-genesis): build the genesis faucet with the V2 policy manager","user":{"login":"PhilippGackstatter","id":18741416,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzQxNDE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18741416?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilippGackstatter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilippGackstatter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n\r\n`miden-usdcx-genesis` now builds the genesis xUSDC faucet with the V2 token policy manager (`TokenPolicyManagerV2`) from [0xMiden/protocol#3997](https://github.com/0xMiden/protocol/pull/3997). With V2, a pause of the faucet stops mints and burns, but transfers and fee payments continue under the send and receive policies.\r\n\r\nThe USDCx faucet issues the network's fee asset, and every fee note triggers the faucet's send callback. The V1 callbacks fail while the faucet is paused, so after a pause no transaction can pay its fee, including the transaction that creates the unpause note. The faucet could then never be unpaused.\r\n\r\nV2 is fixed in code and is not a config option, because a V1 genesis faucet can make the network impossible to unpause.\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[[entry]]\r\nscope       = \"general\"\r\nimpact      = \"changed\"\r\ndescription = \"`miden-usdcx-genesis` builds the genesis USDCx faucet with the V2 token policy manager, so pausing the faucet no longer blocks fee payments.\"\r\n```\r\n","created_at":"2026-10-07T07:11:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T08:31:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-07T08:31:06Z","merged_at":"2026-10-07T08:31:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"c7037fcad234d9a08602009c77f1fdd3f41936db","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/pulls/2743/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/pulls/2743/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/issues/2743/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xMiden/node/statuses/b01777f1417447375ba8f48783ab574af4103464","head":{"label":"0xMiden:pgackst-usdcx-policy-manager-v2","ref":"pgackst-usdcx-policy-manager-v2","sha":"b01777f1417447375ba8f48783ab574af4103464","user":{"login":"0xMiden","id":190780847,"node_id":"O_kgDOC18Vrw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190780847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xMiden","html_url":"https://github.com/0xMiden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xMiden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xMiden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xMiden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xMid